# NOTICE — third-party and inherited content

**The licences above apply only to material whose rights the authors hold.** Parts of this
repository are not theirs to license, and nothing here grants you rights in them:

- **Textbook-derived content.** Several notebooks work through examples, datasets and
  figures from *Forecasting: Principles and Practice* (3rd ed.) by Rob J. Hyndman and
  George Athanasopoulos (<https://otexts.com/fpp3/>). That book's text and figures remain
  the authors' copyright. The `fpp3` R package itself is separately licensed (GPL-3).

- **Third-party datasets.** The files in `data/` were obtained from external sources and
  carry their own terms. They are included for classroom use only. Check the original
  source before redistributing any of them.

- **Institutional material.** Course rules, assessment structure and policies originate
  with IE University and are reproduced here for students' convenience only. The official
  syllabus governs.

If you want to reuse any part of this repository beyond what the licences above allow,
please ask first:

- Alejandro Berrizbeitia — aberrizbeitia@faculty.ie.edu
- Juan Garbayo — jgarbayo@faculty.ie.edu
